; FBX 7.4.0 project file
; A handwritten test model of the FBX import (editor/tests/FbxImportTest.cpp,
; tools/mcp/tests/test_fbx.py): a 2 m cube in meters, Y up, with one textured
; material, a two-bone skin (Root holds the bottom corners, Bone the top ones),
; a "Bulge" blend shape lifting the top corners and the "Take 001" animation
; (Bone turns 90 degrees about Z and the bulge goes 0 -> 100% over one second).
; ----------------------------------------------------

